This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the OWASP Mobile Application Security Verification Standard (MASVS) as a
grounded IDD graph so consuming projects can compose it with throughline.

The MASVS control text reproduced here (items' `text`/`rationale`/`attrs.source_ref`) is taken from:

  - OWASP Mobile Application Security Verification Standard (MASVS) — https://github.com/OWASP/masvs

