with attribution to the OWASP Foundation.

Changes: the MASVS has been restructured as a throughline graph. Each control is a
separate item with a UID of this repository's own, grouped under the MASVS's categories and
linked to them; the published MASVS reference of each control is kept in
`attrs.source_ref`. Any change to the wording of a control is recorded in this
repository's history.

